<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.1" creator="mtl_bike tools/build.py" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1 http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1/gpx.xsd"><metadata><name>Day 2 (Monday Oct 5): Brewster to Hudson, NY</name><desc>81.7 mi (131.5 km), about +1,400 ft. Routed on OpenStreetMap along the official trails.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="41.40567" lon="-73.58022"><name>Hotel: Heidi's Inn</name><desc>Mile 67.5. 1270 Route 22, Brewster, NY. (845) 279-8011. Motel on NY-22, about 3 mi past the end of the Putnam Trailway (through Brewster village). Confirm bike storage when booking.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.38536" lon="-73.58489"><name>Hotel: Comfort Inn Brewster</name><desc>Mile 67.0, 1.1 mi off route. 7-11 Peach Lake Rd, Brewster, NY. (845) 363-0974. About 2 mi east of Brewster village near I-84. Free hot breakfast.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.44300" lon="-73.57600"><name>Bike: Route 22 Cycles</name><desc>Mile 67.5, 2.6 mi off route. 2237 Route 22, Brewster, NY. (845) 784-6166. Hours not verified: call before relying on it.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.42620" lon="-73.58000"><name>Bike: Ski Haus (bikes)</name><desc>Mile 67.5, 1.4 mi off route. 1611 Route 22, Brewster, NY. (845) 279-3100. Listed Wed to Fri 11 to 6, Sat 11 to 5; closed Sun to Tue.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.39471" lon="-73.61970"><name>Station: Brewster station</name><desc>Mile 65.2, 0.1 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.39435" lon="-73.61993"><name>Station: Brewster</name><desc>Mile 65.2, 0.1 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.98628" lon="-73.88201"><name>Lunch: Red Hook Diner</name><desc>Mile 61.5. 7329 S Broadway, Red Hook, NY. (845) 758-5000. On the route (US-9) in Red Hook village. Listed open daily 8 AM to 9 PM. Backup: Taste Budd's Cafe, 40 W Market St (listed Mon to Sat 7 AM to 7 PM). The Historic Village Diner (7550 N Broadway) is closed Mondays.</desc><sym>Restaurant</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.24871" lon="-73.78506"><name>Hotel: Hudson Whaler Hotel (formerly The Barlow)</name><desc>Mile 81.7. 542 Warren St, Hudson, NY. (518) 217-4334. The Barlow Hotel was sold and reopened as the Hudson Whaler: same building, new name and phone number.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.25306" lon="-73.79604"><name>Hotel: The Wick, Hudson (Tribute Portfolio)</name><desc>Mile 81.7, 0.6 mi off route. 41 Cross St, Hudson, NY. (518) 249-6825. Near the Hudson Amtrak station.</desc><sym>Lodging</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.58548" lon="-73.80699"><name>Bike: Bikeway at Hopewell Depot</name><desc>Mile 27.8. Hopewell Depot, Dutchess Rail Trail, Hopewell Junction, NY. (845) 463-4000. Seasonal rentals and repairs at the trailhead; main line is Bikeway's Wappingers Falls shop. Call for October hours.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.92749" lon="-73.91388"><name>Bike: Rhinebeck Bicycle Shop</name><desc>Mile 57.7, 1.7 mi off route. 10 Garden St, Rhinebeck, NY. (845) 876-4025. Repairs, parts, rentals. One block from Bread Alone. Call for hours.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.25278" lon="-73.79132"><name>Bike: Steiner's Sports</name><desc>Mile 81.7, 0.4 mi off route. 301 Warren St, Hudson, NY. (518) 828-5063. Bike sales and service. Listed Mon to Fri 10 to 6, Sat 10 to 5, Sun from 11.</desc><sym>Bike Trail</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="41.70704" lon="-73.93802"><name>Station: Poughkeepsie</name><desc>Mile 40.7, 0.6 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <wpt lat="42.25407" lon="-73.79778"><name>Station: Hudson</name><desc>Mile 81.7, 0.7 mi off route.</desc><sym>Train</sym></wpt>
  <trk><name>Day 2 (Monday Oct 5): Brewster to Hudson, NY</name><desc>81.7 mi (131.5 km), about +1,400 ft. Routed on OpenStreetMap along the official trails.</desc><trkseg>
